('Gate and race reconstruction','pipeline/reconstruction.py','Ingestion','Positions, course sequences, source timing and classifications become starts, directed crossings, legs and finish states. Endpoint extension and sampled moving marks are reconstruction assumptions. Consumers include analytics, exports and historical windows.','tests/unit/test_reconstruction.py','Active'),
